Error [E0991]: `copy` is now the method `x.copy()`
  --> tests/ui/copy_keyword_retired_e0991.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     saved :: copy name
    |              ^^^^
 Why: Jet has exactly one spelling for a copy — the built-in method `.copy()` (D-COPY-WORD1) — so all code reads the same
 Fix: Write `name.copy()` in place of `copy name`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0991
